  1449	        <h1>The obligation<br>is <em>real.</em><br>So is the crisis.</h1>
  1450	        <p class="donor-hero-body">
  1451	          Technological displacement is not an economic inconvenience. It is a
  1452	          spiritual crisis — a forcible removal of human beings from the vocation
  1453	          God assigned them at creation. The community of faith has a corresponding
  1454	          obligation to respond. We are that response.
  1455	        </p>
  1456	        <div class="btn-group">
  1457	          <a class="btn-primary" onclick="gotoSection('donor-give')">Support the Mission</a>
  1458	          <a class="btn-outline-dark" onclick="gotoSection('donor-case')">Read the Case</a>
  1459	        </div>
  1460	      </div>
  1461	      <div class="donor-stat-box">
  1462	        <div class="stat-number">0</div>
  1463	        <div class="stat-label">Cost to participants.<br>Every pathway. Every credential.<br>Every placement service.</div>
  1464	      </div>
  1465	    </div>
  1466	  </section>
